metafolder @VERSION@ (@TARGET@)

A local metadata manager: a daemon holding repositories, a command line (mf)
and a graphical interface over its HTTP API.

Install
    ./install.sh                 into ~/.local (--prefix DIR elsewhere)
    ./install.sh --watchd        also the fanotify broker, a system service (sudo)

Then put ~/.local/bin on your PATH, start metafolder-daemon, and run mf or
metafolder-gui. Running install.sh of a newer release upgrades: the new
defaults are merged with your edits of ~/.config/metafolder/.

Runtime dependencies
    the GUI: webkit2gtk-4.1, gtk3, librsvg, bubblewrap; optional tools
    (ffmpeg, poppler, an emoji font…) each switch a feature on.
    The full list is in the documentation, installed with the configuration:
    ~/.config/metafolder/docs/, note "GUI runtime dependencies".
